<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document appearance */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; display: inline-block; min-width: 150px; margin-bottom: 50px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo/Seal -->
    <div style="width: 100px; height: 100px; margin: 0 auto 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></div>
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">KEAN UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 0;">TAX</h2>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Consent for Electronic W-2 Wage and Tax Statements</h2>

  <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">
    <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span> is required by the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) to furnish all employees a Form W-2 Wage and Tax Statement each calendar year to be used in completing the employee's annual tax returns. The Form W-2 Tax Statement details the employee's wages, tax withholding and other important payroll information for the calendar year. <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span> employees may elect to receive their Form W-2 Wage and Tax Statements electronically in the same way bi-weekly pay stubs are accessed — through Payroll Portal.
  </p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Consent</h3>

  <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">
    The IRS has approved the distribution of Form W-2 in electronic form in lieu of paper. Employee consent is required in order to initiate this request. Please read the entirety of this notice and login to your Payroll Portal account to provide your consent to receive W-2 Wage and Tax Statements in electronic format.
  </p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Disclosures</h3>

  <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">
    An employee's consent is valid for all subsequent tax years unless revoked by the employee, termination of the employee, or the electronic delivery method is no longer supported.
  </p>

  <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">
    An employee who chooses to receive his/her Form W-2 online can change his/her mind and withdraw consent to online delivery by returning to the Online Consent Form and choosing the "Withdraw Consent" option. An employee's withdrawal of consent will be effective on the date received. If consent is withdrawn, it will only be effective for those W-2 statements not yet issued.
  </p>

  <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">
    To consent to electronic delivery of Form W-2 for the current Tax Year and after:
  </p>

  <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">
    To consent to electronic delivery of Form W-2 for Tax Year <span data-field="tax_year_start">{{ tax_year_start }}</span> and after:
  </p>

  <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">
    Please complete the section below and return this notice to the Payroll Department via inter-office mail, email (<span data-field="payroll_email">{{ payroll_email }}</span>) or fax (<span data-field="payroll_fax">{{ payroll_fax }}</span>):
  </p>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px; padding-left: 20px;">
    <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">O</span> By signing below, I consent to electronic delivery of my W2 Tax and Wage Statements for the following tax years and after (check the earliest year for which you give consent):
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.9em;">
      <span style="flex-grow: 1; text-align: center;">2012</span>
      <span style="flex-grow: 1; text-align: center;">2013</span>
      <span style="flex-grow: 1; text-align: center;">2014</span>
      <span style="flex-grow: 1; text-align: center;">2015</span>
      <span style="flex-grow: 1; text-align: center;">2016</span>
      <span style="flex-grow: 1; text-align: center;">2017</span>
      <span style="flex-grow: 1; text-align: center;">2018</span>
      <span style="flex-grow: 1; text-align: center;">2019</span>
      <span style="flex-grow: 1; text-align: center;">2020</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">Printed Name: <span class="signature-line"></span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">ID#: <span class="signature-line"></span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">Signature: <span class="signature-line"></span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">Date: <span class="signature-line"></span></p>
  </div>

  <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 100px; font-size: 0.9em;">
    If you have questions, please contact the Payroll office at <span data-field="payroll_phone">{{ payroll_phone }}</span>.
  </p>
</div>